# A Map Folded Twice
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
This atlas is older than we are.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
Most of the roads are probably gone.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
That does not mean the places are. Look: a town where the lanterns float on the river.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Would you like to see it?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
I would like to be asked when we are not talking about medicine.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You leave a ribbon between the pages.
